title: "UK Employment Law Knowledge Base"
abstract: >-
  Markdown corpus of Great Britain employment law for LLM assistants serving
  workers and workplace representatives. Contains the revised text of 10 Acts
  (including the Employment Rights Act 2025) plus SSCBA 1992 extracts, 22
  statutory instruments, the five statutory Acas Codes, 620 Acas advice pages
  and 136 GOV.UK guides, with original method guides, tribunal procedure,
  representative guidance, leading cases and letter templates. Every file
  carries a YAML header with source, URI, version date and licence; one heading
  per statutory section for deterministic chunking. Snapshot of 3 November 2026,
  Acts revised to 30 October 2026, prospective changes flagged rather than
  applied.
